1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[English subtitles are available]

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:08,440
[One day,]

3
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:15,880
[a group of powerful Sikawasay
came to a tribe.]

4
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:20,410
[They gave the people rich harvests]

5
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:26,130
[and cured their illnesses.]

6
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:30,750
[There was a girl who was very sick.]

7
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:36,730
[None of the Sikawasay had a cure.]

8
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:40,960
[And so they locked her up]

9
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,540
[and left her to die.]

10
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:44,870
[Unexpectedly, a few days later,]

11
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:49,100
[the girl recovered]

12
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:51,170
[and became a Sikawasay herself.]

13
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:52,490
[That was how she knew]

14
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:58,650
[the Sikawasay were Kariah and imposters.]

15
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:03,490
[The Kariah were afraid of being exposed.]

16
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:05,550
[Under the guise of sacrifice,]

17
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:10,830
[they pushed the girl from a cliff
into the thick fog.]

18
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,160
[Even when she breathed her last breath,]

19
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:17,740
[the girl never revealed the truth.]

20
00:01:17,870 --> 00:01:22,800
[Then Kakarayan's messenger,
the god of rain,]

21
00:01:22,890 --> 00:01:27,289
[caught the girl's spirit.]

22
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:28,870
[He asked her,]

23
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:32,830
["Why didn't you expose them?"]

24
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:36,090
[The girl answered,]

25
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:41,320
["If I don't tell the people,
they can continue to live in the lie.]

26
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:47,180
[If I did, their dreams would be crushed.]

27
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:51,140
[All that would be left
is a tattered reality."]

28
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:53,380
[When the god of rain heard that,]

29
00:01:53,470 --> 00:01:58,310
[he named her Toem]

30
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:02,710
[and made her the goddess of cloud]

31
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:06,710
[in charge of protecting everyone's lies]

32
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:11,550
[and every wish that was never realized.]

33
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:23,690
Do you know who you are?

34
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,920
Do you know why you're here

35
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:33,510
and what your name is?

36
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,700
Your name is Falo.

37
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,460
Falo.

38
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:42,000
Yes.

39
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:44,370
Falo.

40
00:02:46,270 --> 00:02:47,630
From now on,

41
00:02:48,110 --> 00:02:50,620
you shall receive Kakarayan's blessings.

42
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:53,310
Your future duty

43
00:02:53,390 --> 00:02:55,290
is to protect this place

44
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:56,079
and bless everyone

45
00:02:56,210 --> 00:02:58,410
who passes through here.

46
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:00,210
Remember your name.

47
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:02,460
Most importantly,

48
00:03:02,550 --> 00:03:04,660
go with Kakarayan's blessings

49
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:07,300
and in turn,
become a blessing to the people.

50
00:03:11,170 --> 00:03:11,920
'Orad.

51
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:14,160
According to the Reflection of Time
you saw yesterday,

52
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:16,410
you should be getting the Comb of Memories
from Fali right now.

53
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:18,030
Why are you still here?

54
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:21,250
'Orad?

55
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:38,710
My name is 'Orad.

56
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,060
From now on,

57
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,090
I will be your guardian angel.

58
00:03:50,990 --> 00:03:52,040
What's happening?

59
00:03:53,010 --> 00:03:54,290
Who is this little girl?

60
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:56,930
I would also like to know.

61
00:03:59,130 --> 00:04:01,680
What is so special about her?

62
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:05,380
Why did Kakarayan tell me to save her?

63
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:10,880
Why did He ask me, the messenger,

64
00:04:11,450 --> 00:04:13,960
to make a vow with her
to be her guardian angel?

65
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,120
I summoned you

66
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:27,290
because I saw you

67
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:28,430
in the Reflection of Time.

68
00:04:29,710 --> 00:04:31,510
I also heard you say to me

69
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:33,180
that the Reflection of Time

70
00:04:35,030 --> 00:04:36,659
was actually a curse.

71
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,960
What else did you see?

72
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,600
I saw another Reflection of time.

73
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:44,970
'Orad seemed

74
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:47,480
to have vanished.

75
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:53,860
I think Kakarayan showed me all of this

76
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,400
for a reason.

77
00:04:56,770 --> 00:04:58,350
Rather than imagining things
in my own head,

78
00:04:58,440 --> 00:04:59,800
I'd better follow what I saw
in the Reflection of Time

79
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:01,740
and summon you here
so that I can ask you directly

80
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:03,100
what exactly is going on.

81
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:05,170
Do you think you're the messenger?

82
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,110
Just because you saw
a few Reflections of Time,

83
00:05:07,330 --> 00:05:08,560
you think you can turn them

84
00:05:08,650 --> 00:05:09,880
into your future?

85
00:05:10,050 --> 00:05:11,150
That's not true.

86
00:05:12,030 --> 00:05:14,280
I don't want it to come true.

87
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:16,210
That was why I called you.

88
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:18,850
Please tell me.

89
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:21,100
Why would 'Orad disappear?

90
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,120
What can I do

91
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:26,200
to stop it?

92
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:29,940
The thing is

93
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,800
when you do any of the things

94
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:34,560
that were shown in the Reflection of Time,

95
00:05:34,650 --> 00:05:36,010
it is already too late to change it.

96
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,110
What do you mean?

97
00:05:43,580 --> 00:05:44,810
Don't you get it?

98
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:48,110
The Reflection of Time itself is a curse.

99
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:49,920
From the moment you see the future,

100
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:51,810
you've already lost your future.

101
00:05:51,900 --> 00:05:53,520
Because from now on, your future

102
00:05:53,659 --> 00:05:55,330
can only be controlled
by the Reflection of Time.

103
00:05:55,460 --> 00:05:56,520
This is the reason

104
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:59,200
why Kakarayan let you see
the Reflection of Time.

105
00:06:02,410 --> 00:06:11,040
[Episode 12, Dreams Like Clouds]

106
00:06:03,290 --> 00:06:04,960
Just like how 'Orad disappeared

107
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:07,080
20 years ago.

108
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:43,920
Even before you met 'Orad,

109
00:07:44,010 --> 00:07:45,460
we had already seen you

110
00:07:45,550 --> 00:07:46,560
in the Reflection of Time.

111
00:07:47,530 --> 00:07:49,070
But we didn't know back then

112
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:52,060
that the Reflection of Time we saw

113
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:54,790
would not only make 'Orad disappear,

114
00:07:57,210 --> 00:07:58,610
but it would also make me lose everything.

115
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:26,770
Where am I?

116
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:28,660
This is a scenery I saw before.

117
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:30,780
You're in my heart right now.

118
00:08:31,350 --> 00:08:33,280
I can move freely in people's hearts.

119
00:08:33,549 --> 00:08:35,400
I can look into 'Orad's heart

120
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,320
and see the Reflection of Time

121
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:38,390
that Kakarayan arranged for him.

122
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,409
That is why

123
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,880
Kakarayan let me stay with him

124
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,020
to assist him.

125
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:25,690
Share the blessings.

126
00:09:26,130 --> 00:09:27,230
Saowac, the god of river.

127
00:09:29,820 --> 00:09:32,110
Share the blessings.

128
00:09:36,290 --> 00:09:38,840
'Orad, I've been upstream.

129
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:39,720
Many of the factories

130
00:09:39,810 --> 00:09:41,660
dumped their wastewater into this creek.

131
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:42,540
That is why the creek

132
00:09:42,630 --> 00:09:44,390
ends up like this.

133
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:54,590
He's the 13th Kawas

134
00:09:54,730 --> 00:09:56,620
who has been injured
in the past three days.

135
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:58,950
If we can't solve the problem
from the source

136
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,530
and stop humanity
from further destruction,

137
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,730
the situation won't get any better.

138
00:10:03,530 --> 00:10:05,020
Why don't you borrow
the Comb of Memories from Fali

139
00:10:05,110 --> 00:10:05,900
and erase

140
00:10:06,030 --> 00:10:07,400
all of the humans' memories?

141
00:10:07,490 --> 00:10:08,450
If this continues,

142
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:10,700
who knows what will happen to the world?

143
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:12,500
How many times have I told you?

144
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:15,450
The messenger's job is to follow his...

145
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,640
I know.

146
00:10:17,610 --> 00:10:19,010
It's to make sure everything

147
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:21,130
is proceeding according
to Kakarayan's plan.

148
00:10:22,490 --> 00:10:23,550
It's good that you know.

149
00:10:24,690 --> 00:10:25,440
So things that don't appear

150
00:10:25,530 --> 00:10:27,020
in the Reflection of Time

151
00:10:27,110 --> 00:10:28,780
are not part of our job.

152
00:10:29,530 --> 00:10:30,500
Stop thinking about it

153
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,570
and stop worrying about it.

154
00:10:36,790 --> 00:10:37,400
Let's go.

155
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,890
Back then,

156
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:44,180
'Orad had never questioned
Kakarayan's arrangement

157
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:45,320
regarding what he saw

158
00:10:45,410 --> 00:10:46,910
in the Reflection of Time.

159
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,320
But when he saw you

160
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,210
in the Reflection of Time,

161
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:52,140
it was the first time

162
00:10:52,230 --> 00:10:53,950
I saw him looking so unrestrained

163
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,800
in the Reflection of Time.

164
00:11:04,990 --> 00:11:05,870
In order to find out

165
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:08,290
why Kakarayan arranged
for you two to meet,

166
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:11,590
why He made him your guardian angel,

167
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:14,540
and why you were so important...

168
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:15,600
He wanted to know

169
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:18,810
what would happen to the two of you
in the future,

170
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:20,700
so he spent more and more time

171
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:23,120
in the Reflection of Time.

172
00:11:51,590 --> 00:11:54,180
[I had never seen 'Orad look like that.]

173
00:11:56,650 --> 00:11:58,050
I knew

174
00:11:58,190 --> 00:11:59,810
he had already fallen in love

175
00:11:59,950 --> 00:12:02,100
with that girl he was meant
to fall in love with in the future.

176
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:06,550
You.

177
00:12:11,430 --> 00:12:13,100
Was that why

178
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:16,090
you wanted to hurt me?

179
00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:18,600
The reason I hurt you

180
00:12:18,690 --> 00:12:20,630
and tried to stop everything
from happening

181
00:12:20,710 --> 00:12:22,340
was not because he loves you.

182
00:12:26,170 --> 00:12:27,180
I was just trying to prevent him

183
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:28,940
from disappearing from this world.

184
00:12:49,670 --> 00:12:50,550
Toem.

185
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,830
You're the goddess of cloud.

186
00:12:56,530 --> 00:12:57,630
Tell me.

187
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,580
When a lie gets found out,

188
00:13:02,290 --> 00:13:03,740
what will happen to it?

189
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:07,920
Tell me!

190
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,640
When a lie is found out,

191
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,790
it will be replaced by the truth.

192
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,000
The original lie

193
00:13:23,810 --> 00:13:25,080
will no longer exist.

194
00:13:30,010 --> 00:13:30,760
'Orad.

195
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:33,620
What's the matter?

196
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:36,660
Did you see something

197
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:37,890
in the Reflection of Time?

198
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:39,250
Why are you...

199
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:44,090
Back then, I didn't know

200
00:13:44,710 --> 00:13:46,470
why he asked me that question.

201
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:48,930
I only understood later on

202
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:51,090
that the lie he mentioned

203
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,510
was his existence.

204
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:01,080
Is this really Kakarayan's will?

205
00:14:02,750 --> 00:14:04,160
Answer me!

206
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:11,240
If you are Kakarayan's secret keeper,

207
00:14:12,290 --> 00:14:13,970
you should know everything.

208
00:14:15,550 --> 00:14:16,740
Tell me.

209
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:19,640
Was the Reflection of Time I saw

210
00:14:21,930 --> 00:14:23,210
real or not?

211
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,630
Since I'm the secret keeper,

212
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:27,740
why would I

213
00:14:29,590 --> 00:14:32,230
or how could I tell you the truth?

214
00:14:33,150 --> 00:14:34,030
The Reflection of Time

215
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,410
is the future Kakarayan has planned.

216
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:39,660
Whatever you saw in there

217
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:42,480
is the answer Kakarayan gave you.

218
00:14:44,850 --> 00:14:47,540
So I never existed.

219
00:14:48,420 --> 00:14:50,490
Is this the answer He wants to give me?

220
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:55,110
Is it?

221
00:15:01,050 --> 00:15:01,930
What...

222
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:05,970
What did you see
in the Reflection of Time?

223
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:08,530
I saw it.

224
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:14,640
I will fall in love
with the person I'm protecting.

225
00:15:16,970 --> 00:15:18,910
And that person will let me know

226
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,420
the truth behind it all.

227
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:26,560
What else?

228
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,040
I saw who I am.

229
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,260
Who are you?

230
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:41,920
I'm just a lie.

231
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:47,950
A lie that Kakarayan told.

232
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:59,300
This is how 'Orad looked
when I saw him disappear

233
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:00,800
in the Reflection of Time.

234
00:16:01,370 --> 00:16:02,420
What exactly did he see

235
00:16:02,510 --> 00:16:03,700
in the Reflection of Time?

236
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,590
How did it come to this?

237
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:11,140
At the time,

238
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:13,030
to find out what he saw,

239
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,400
I had gone into his heart

240
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,250
before he vanished.

241
00:16:19,190 --> 00:16:20,200
And?

242
00:16:20,770 --> 00:16:23,240
What did you see in his heart?

243
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:25,740
You.

244
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,410
I saw you in his heart.

245
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,870
[This is what I saw in 'Orad's heart]

246
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,030
[right before he disappeared.]

247
00:17:02,970 --> 00:17:04,640
[I didn't understand.]

248
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:06,400
[Even though he was about to disappear,]

249
00:17:06,530 --> 00:17:07,670
[the image he thought of]

250
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,750
[was such an ordinary moment.]

251
00:17:14,540 --> 00:17:16,250
[I knew what I was seeing]

252
00:17:16,339 --> 00:17:18,410
[was the reason why he would disappear.]

253
00:17:19,770 --> 00:17:21,710
[So I made a decision.]

254
00:17:35,790 --> 00:17:37,070
From now on,

255
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:39,700
you'll forget
the Reflection of Time you've seen.

256
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:41,730
From now on,

257
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:44,410
you won't be able to see
the Reflection of Time anymore.

258
00:17:44,630 --> 00:17:45,820
From now on,

259
00:17:47,670 --> 00:17:49,080
you'll forget about everything

260
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,970
that happened between us.

261
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:53,650
In your eyes,

262
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,690
I'm just a Kawas who renounced Kakarayan.

263
00:17:58,050 --> 00:17:59,150
No matter what terrible things

264
00:17:59,370 --> 00:18:02,010
I might do to you in the future,

265
00:18:03,730 --> 00:18:05,930
you won't feel disappointed.

266
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,630
And you won't remember

267
00:18:47,730 --> 00:18:49,790
what I'm saying to you now.

268
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:52,920
I'm sorry.

269
00:19:00,750 --> 00:19:02,110
I think you already know

270
00:19:02,250 --> 00:19:03,870
what was about to happen.

271
00:19:04,930 --> 00:19:06,910
After 'Orad forgot everything,

272
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,010
I decided

273
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,520
to make sure he would never encounter you.

274
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:19,270
So this accident

275
00:19:21,210 --> 00:19:22,530
happened because of you.

276
00:19:26,890 --> 00:19:28,870
-It was so that 'Orad wouldn't meet you.
-Tien-ti!

277
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,630
It was so that he wouldn't disappear.

278
00:19:31,510 --> 00:19:32,390
I never expected

279
00:19:32,470 --> 00:19:34,280
-to have to pay such a hefty price.
-Tien-ti!

280
00:19:34,410 --> 00:19:36,920
From a Kawas, I became a Kariah.

281
00:19:37,490 --> 00:19:38,850
Tien-ti!

282
00:19:39,650 --> 00:19:41,320
Little girl, can you hear me?

283
00:19:42,370 --> 00:19:45,100
Tien-ti.

284
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:46,730
Grandma.

285
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,580
It hurts.

286
00:20:01,510 --> 00:20:03,490
I don't need you
to understand my decision.

287
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:07,450
But what I'm about to say
is very important.

288
00:20:08,550 --> 00:20:10,800
Listen carefully.

289
00:20:15,860 --> 00:20:16,910
Please get in.

290
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,690
Stop it, Toem.

291
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,690
I don't care what your reason is

292
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:29,720
for defying Kakarayan's will,

293
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:32,140
giving up your identity as a Kawas,

294
00:20:32,930 --> 00:20:34,820
and becoming a fallen Kariah.

295
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:38,600
I also don't care what your reason is

296
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,760
for hurting that girl.

297
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:43,620
But I'm telling you to give up.

298
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:46,040
Because in the near future,

299
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,240
I will be her guardian angel.

300
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:56,250
You will be her guardian angel?

301
00:20:56,820 --> 00:20:57,570
That's right.

302
00:20:58,140 --> 00:21:00,080
In accordance with Kakarayan's will,

303
00:21:01,090 --> 00:21:03,240
no matter how much you hurt her
in the future,

304
00:21:03,990 --> 00:21:05,180
I'll always appear before her

305
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:07,600
to protect her like this.

306
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:09,840
So if you're going

307
00:21:09,930 --> 00:21:11,730
to interfere with my work,

308
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:14,150
don't blame me for not going easy on you.

309
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:18,910
[Why?]

310
00:21:19,430 --> 00:21:20,490
I used the Comb of Memories

311
00:21:20,580 --> 00:21:22,120
to erase 'Orad's memory.

312
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:24,050
But...

313
00:21:24,140 --> 00:21:25,020
he still showed up there

314
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:26,340
just like in the Reflection of Time.

315
00:21:27,220 --> 00:21:28,720
He's still protecting that girl.

316
00:21:29,860 --> 00:21:30,610
Why...

317
00:21:31,620 --> 00:21:32,990
does he still remember everything

318
00:21:33,070 --> 00:21:34,390
like before,

319
00:21:35,670 --> 00:21:37,120
but he doesn't remember me?

320
00:21:38,090 --> 00:21:39,540
The answer is simple.

321
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:41,480
You used the Comb of Memories

322
00:21:41,570 --> 00:21:43,190
to erase 'Orad's memory,

323
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:45,090
but you weren't able to change

324
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:47,330
Kakarayan's plan for him.

325
00:21:51,510 --> 00:21:53,050
So no matter what I do,

326
00:21:53,230 --> 00:21:54,850
I can't change the future?

327
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,390
In the end,

328
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:58,200
'Orad is still going to vanish?

329
00:22:04,140 --> 00:22:05,900
Don't worry about that.

330
00:22:06,510 --> 00:22:09,590
Don't forget,
I'm Kakarayan's secret keeper.

331
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:12,410
The lie that you fear will get exposed

332
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:14,430
is the secret

333
00:22:14,520 --> 00:22:15,620
Kakarayan entrusted me to keep.

334
00:22:16,630 --> 00:22:17,910
Rest assured and leave it to me.

335
00:22:18,610 --> 00:22:20,860
I'll do everything I can from now on

336
00:22:22,040 --> 00:22:24,070
to keep 'Orad away from the truth.

337
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:30,100
[You can leave.]

338
00:22:31,990 --> 00:22:33,130
From now on,

339
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:35,950
you don't have to guard
the stream anymore.

340
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:38,150
You no longer have to bless

341
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:39,780
the people who come through the stream.

342
00:22:41,580 --> 00:22:42,590
Leave?

343
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:46,330
When you gave me my name,

344
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:47,430
you told me

345
00:22:47,520 --> 00:22:49,500
Kakarayan wanted me to protect this place

346
00:22:49,590 --> 00:22:50,860
and take care of everything here.

347
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,890
If I leave today,

348
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:54,380
what else can I do?

349
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:56,010
Don't worry.

350
00:22:56,540 --> 00:22:58,610
Kakarayan has given you a new arrangement.

351
00:23:05,470 --> 00:23:08,420
Come with me and join
the Cause and Effect Correction Bureau.

352
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:10,620
Assist me in completing the tasks

353
00:23:10,710 --> 00:23:12,560
that Kakarayan has given me.

354
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:39,090
I think you must want to know

355
00:23:39,170 --> 00:23:41,110
who that Kawas was

356
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,520
and why he came here

357
00:23:42,610 --> 00:23:43,750
with 'Orad.

358
00:23:45,470 --> 00:23:46,920
This is the Cause and Effect
Correction Bureau

359
00:23:47,010 --> 00:23:48,550
that I set up for 'Orad.

360
00:23:48,630 --> 00:23:50,480
Next up, the bureau

361
00:23:50,570 --> 00:23:53,030
will take over
your previous responsibilities.

362
00:23:53,470 --> 00:23:54,970
The Kawas you just saw

363
00:23:55,060 --> 00:23:56,910
and more like him will join the bureau

364
00:23:56,990 --> 00:23:58,050
to assist 'Orad

365
00:23:58,140 --> 00:24:00,380
in carrying out the Reflection of Time
that he saw.

366
00:24:02,010 --> 00:24:03,510
While he is following
the Reflection of Time

367
00:24:03,950 --> 00:24:06,410
and performing his duties
as the messenger,

368
00:24:06,540 --> 00:24:09,090
I'll even help him build his own life.

369
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:11,560
I'll protect him

370
00:24:12,130 --> 00:24:13,630
and keep him away from the truth.

371
00:24:14,460 --> 00:24:15,690
I'll keep him away

372
00:24:17,670 --> 00:24:18,730
from the truth

373
00:24:18,860 --> 00:24:20,230
that neither of us wants him to know.

374
00:24:21,590 --> 00:24:22,910
So starting today,

375
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:24,580
he is no longer your concern.

376
00:24:24,670 --> 00:24:25,640
Stay out of the matter.

377
00:24:29,860 --> 00:24:31,670
Did I mishear you? Seven years old?

378
00:24:31,750 --> 00:24:33,070
You said she is only seven years old.

379
00:24:33,210 --> 00:24:34,350
And Kakarayan wants you to protect her

380
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:36,020
and take care of her forever?

381
00:24:36,420 --> 00:24:39,100
'Orad, think about it.

382
00:24:39,190 --> 00:24:40,820
You're thousands of years old.

383
00:24:40,910 --> 00:24:41,740
Why are you suddenly

384
00:24:41,830 --> 00:24:43,020
looking after a child?

385
00:24:43,100 --> 00:24:44,380
That's just weird.

386
00:24:44,470 --> 00:24:46,450
What kind of a weird plan is this?

387
00:24:46,580 --> 00:24:47,810
How many times have I told you?

388
00:24:47,900 --> 00:24:48,560
As the messenger...

389
00:24:48,690 --> 00:24:49,620
I know.

390
00:24:49,700 --> 00:24:51,290
I know what you want to say.

391
00:24:53,090 --> 00:24:54,810
"As the messenger,

392
00:24:54,940 --> 00:24:57,010
my job is to follow Kakarayan's order

393
00:24:57,100 --> 00:24:59,820
to carry out
what the Reflection of Time shows.

394
00:24:59,910 --> 00:25:03,430
Nothing else matters."

395
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:06,030
How is it? Do I sound like you?

396
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:08,180
Do you see another copy of yourself?

397
00:25:08,270 --> 00:25:09,200
I'm glad you know.

398
00:25:12,540 --> 00:25:13,550
No, wait.

399
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:14,610
'Orad!

400
00:25:14,780 --> 00:25:16,020
Mr. Messenger!

401
00:25:26,580 --> 00:25:27,500
Tien-ti!

402
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:31,330
Give it up. She's mine now.

403
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,160
[My name is 'Orad.]

404
00:25:40,830 --> 00:25:42,370
From now on,

405
00:25:43,030 --> 00:25:45,230
I will be your guardian angel.

406
00:25:51,260 --> 00:25:53,110
Could it be that I'm the reason

407
00:25:53,630 --> 00:25:55,260
'Orad became her guardian angel?

408
00:25:55,790 --> 00:25:58,390
I told you to stay out of it.

409
00:26:00,150 --> 00:26:01,730
The Reflection of Time
that Kakarayan arranged

410
00:26:01,860 --> 00:26:03,090
cannot be changed.

411
00:26:03,180 --> 00:26:04,810
There's no doubt about it.

412
00:26:06,390 --> 00:26:07,930
The more you try to interfere,

413
00:26:11,810 --> 00:26:14,450
the more likely
that what you fear will happen.

414
00:26:19,070 --> 00:26:20,560
[I know I won't be able to change]

415
00:26:20,740 --> 00:26:21,660
[Kakarayan's will]

416
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:23,420
by myself.

417
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:25,530
The only thing I could do

418
00:26:25,620 --> 00:26:27,560
was to believe Fali's words.

419
00:26:27,650 --> 00:26:30,020
I believed that he'd keep the secret

420
00:26:30,110 --> 00:26:32,180
for me and Kakarayan.

421
00:26:33,630 --> 00:26:34,910
That is

422
00:26:36,090 --> 00:26:38,510
'Orad never existed.

423
00:26:39,570 --> 00:26:40,630
He is just a lie

424
00:26:40,710 --> 00:26:42,250
Kakarayan made up.

425
00:26:44,630 --> 00:26:46,870
'Orad is just a lie?

426
00:26:50,090 --> 00:26:51,410
I just didn't think

427
00:26:51,980 --> 00:26:53,390
that as the goddess of cloud,

428
00:26:53,910 --> 00:26:55,630
I would be tricked as well.

429
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:21,240
What should we do?

430
00:27:21,370 --> 00:27:23,390
How did the messenger end up
in Hsieh Tien-ti's house?

431
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:25,590
And they even broke the Comb of Memories.

432
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:27,040
It's okay.

433
00:27:27,130 --> 00:27:27,660
Fali will personally

434
00:27:27,750 --> 00:27:29,730
take care of the rest.

435
00:27:29,820 --> 00:27:31,440
How can I not worry?

436
00:27:31,530 --> 00:27:32,240
Don't you know

437
00:27:32,320 --> 00:27:33,380
what it means

438
00:27:33,470 --> 00:27:34,920
when the messenger breaks the comb?

439
00:27:35,010 --> 00:27:35,890
It means he'll remember

440
00:27:36,020 --> 00:27:37,960
all the memories that have been altered.

441
00:27:38,090 --> 00:27:40,730
This has never happened before.

442
00:27:41,870 --> 00:27:44,640
You mean 'Orad regained his memory

443
00:27:44,730 --> 00:27:46,980
when I broke the comb that night?

444
00:27:49,130 --> 00:27:51,510
Doesn't that mean he also remembered

445
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:54,100
that he almost vanished?

446
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:56,440
But when I saw 'Orad again,

447
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:59,910
he acted as if nothing happened.

448
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,980
He even went to your office with Li Pu-hui

449
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:03,610
to get the comb back.

450
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:05,980
If I have to make a guess,

451
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,570
Fali probably used the Comb of Memories

452
00:28:07,660 --> 00:28:09,020
to alter his memory.

453
00:28:09,900 --> 00:28:10,820
But why did he

454
00:28:11,790 --> 00:28:13,550
only change 'Orad memory

455
00:28:14,030 --> 00:28:16,370
but left you,
who remembers everything, untouched?

456
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:24,290
In the end, the truth is

457
00:28:25,030 --> 00:28:26,790
I never existed.

458
00:28:27,540 --> 00:28:29,300
I'm only a made-up character

459
00:28:30,800 --> 00:28:32,730
you find in some fairy tales.

460
00:28:36,610 --> 00:28:38,370
I never existed.

461
00:28:56,670 --> 00:28:57,730
Give me the comb.

462
00:28:59,310 --> 00:29:00,980
Why do you need the Comb of Memories?

463
00:29:01,420 --> 00:29:02,830
I want you to give me back

464
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:04,770
my memory!

465
00:29:06,260 --> 00:29:08,330
If you hadn't changed my memory,

466
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:11,540
how could I have forgotten his name?

467
00:29:11,850 --> 00:29:12,860
How could I have forgotten

468
00:29:12,950 --> 00:29:14,310
what I went through with him?

469
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:16,870
Do you really think

470
00:29:16,950 --> 00:29:18,800
that if you remember
what you went through with him,

471
00:29:19,070 --> 00:29:20,830
that would prove he actually existed

472
00:29:20,910 --> 00:29:23,550
and was not just
an imaginary character I made up?

473
00:29:26,060 --> 00:29:27,470
And then he'd come back?

474
00:29:57,700 --> 00:30:00,200
If You can hear me...

475
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:11,160
What I wish to see

476
00:30:12,520 --> 00:30:18,680
will become what you shall see.

477
00:30:53,660 --> 00:30:55,070
[That was the first time]

478
00:30:55,550 --> 00:30:56,830
I experienced something

479
00:30:56,920 --> 00:30:58,720
that didn't take place
in the Reflection of Time.

480
00:31:04,790 --> 00:31:06,110
[Fali.]

481
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:09,060
[That movie never appeared]

482
00:31:09,150 --> 00:31:10,600
[in the Reflection of Time.]

483
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:12,630
Does that mean

484
00:31:13,460 --> 00:31:16,230
the Reflection of Time
is not set in stone?

485
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:17,990
Just as Hsieh Tien-ti said,

486
00:31:18,390 --> 00:31:20,110
everything can still change.

487
00:31:21,380 --> 00:31:24,550
If change is possible,

488
00:31:25,830 --> 00:31:28,910
then maybe she won't have to die tomorrow.

489
00:31:32,290 --> 00:31:34,710
So are you questioning
the Reflection of Time

490
00:31:34,800 --> 00:31:36,520
that Kakarayan showed you?

491
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:39,730
I'm not doubting Kakarayan. I just...

492
00:31:42,850 --> 00:31:45,450
What I wish to say

493
00:31:45,540 --> 00:31:49,190
will become what you hear.

494
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:50,770
The girl called you over to her house

495
00:31:50,900 --> 00:31:52,930
the night before she dies.

496
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:55,170
So she couldn't hold it in anymore

497
00:31:55,260 --> 00:31:56,580
and asked you to spare her life.

498
00:31:56,760 --> 00:31:58,210
She asked me to watch a movie.

499
00:31:58,380 --> 00:31:59,090
Watch a movie?

500
00:32:00,190 --> 00:32:01,460
Is this the time

501
00:32:01,550 --> 00:32:02,740
to be watching a movie?

502
00:32:03,270 --> 00:32:03,970
It's true.

503
00:32:06,660 --> 00:32:08,370
It was just a movie.

504
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:10,700
Give me back my comb.

505
00:32:11,800 --> 00:32:12,730
Give it back.

506
00:32:19,110 --> 00:32:20,560
Tell me, Fali.

507
00:32:22,230 --> 00:32:24,300
What's all this about?

508
00:32:28,260 --> 00:32:29,400
It's not yet time

509
00:32:29,490 --> 00:32:30,940
for you to know the truth.

510
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:34,070
I want you to watch her die.

511
00:32:35,170 --> 00:32:36,310
Before that,

512
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:39,660
I won't make it easy for you

513
00:32:39,790 --> 00:32:41,940
to escape from this lie.

514
00:32:42,030 --> 00:32:46,300
The things that I dreamed of

515
00:32:46,430 --> 00:32:52,110
will become the paths you take.

516
00:32:57,340 --> 00:32:59,190
[And you won't remember]

517
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:02,710
[what I'm saying to you now.]

518
00:33:03,190 --> 00:33:04,120
I'm sorry.

519
00:33:15,560 --> 00:33:16,390
Are you okay?

520
00:33:20,970 --> 00:33:21,670
Fali.

521
00:33:23,170 --> 00:33:24,490
Why am I here?

522
00:33:44,950 --> 00:33:46,270
I can't see the Reflection of Time.

523
00:33:48,430 --> 00:33:50,050
You can't see the Reflection of Time?

524
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:55,770
No. Why am I here?

525
00:33:57,490 --> 00:34:01,670
Didn't you come here to find me

526
00:34:01,930 --> 00:34:03,560
because of the Reflection of Time?

527
00:34:05,760 --> 00:34:06,510
Is that so?

528
00:34:09,020 --> 00:34:09,900
I can't remember.

529
00:34:12,230 --> 00:34:13,679
Then did it ever occur to you

530
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:17,820
that you came here to find me

531
00:34:22,170 --> 00:34:24,590
because I'm the only Kawas
who can help you?

532
00:34:25,820 --> 00:34:26,570
I...

533
00:34:29,699 --> 00:34:31,370
I'm the longest living Kawas

534
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:33,570
in this world.

535
00:34:35,239 --> 00:34:39,820
The first Kawas Kakarayan created.

536
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,860
I came to this world

537
00:34:44,790 --> 00:34:46,989
long before you.

538
00:34:52,050 --> 00:34:54,070
Please tell me.

539
00:34:54,510 --> 00:34:56,800
When you were still able
to see the Reflection of Time,

540
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:04,460
how did you manage to see

541
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:08,460
the Reflection of Time
Kakarayan wanted you to see?

542
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:12,200
How did you do it?

543
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:15,190
Try it.

544
00:35:20,510 --> 00:35:22,890
Whenever I wanted to see
the Reflection of Time,

545
00:35:26,320 --> 00:35:29,490
I would close my eyes

546
00:35:29,580 --> 00:35:30,590
and ask

547
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:34,550
what I should do next

548
00:35:35,250 --> 00:35:36,310
and where I should go.

549
00:35:38,290 --> 00:35:39,130
Then the Reflection of Time

550
00:35:39,210 --> 00:35:40,800
that Kakarayan has arranged

551
00:35:41,900 --> 00:35:43,570
would appear before me.

552
00:35:44,980 --> 00:35:49,070
The things that I dreamed of...

553
00:35:49,160 --> 00:35:50,830
[From now on,]

554
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:53,690
[you'll forget
the Reflection of Time you've seen.]

555
00:35:53,780 --> 00:35:55,230
[-From now on,]
-will become

556
00:35:55,320 --> 00:35:56,730
[you won't be able to see
the Reflection of Time anymore.]

557
00:35:56,810 --> 00:35:57,960
the paths

558
00:35:58,050 --> 00:35:59,850
[From now on,]

559
00:36:01,210 --> 00:36:02,180
[you'll forget about everything]

560
00:36:02,270 --> 00:36:03,150
you take.

561
00:36:03,240 --> 00:36:04,950
[that happened between us.]

562
00:36:11,950 --> 00:36:13,010
I remember now.

563
00:36:16,090 --> 00:36:17,670
I remember everything.

564
00:36:22,510 --> 00:36:23,830
Since that day

565
00:36:25,550 --> 00:36:27,790
when Toem erased my memory,

566
00:36:29,110 --> 00:36:32,850
the following Reflection of Time I saw

567
00:36:33,860 --> 00:36:35,840
were what you wanted me to see.

568
00:36:38,570 --> 00:36:40,110
Everything that happened
between Tien-ti and me

569
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,500
was all part of your plan.

570
00:36:45,390 --> 00:36:47,240
Whenever I deviated from your plan,

571
00:36:47,680 --> 00:36:49,040
you would alter my memory

572
00:36:49,700 --> 00:36:51,330
just like you did that night

573
00:36:52,080 --> 00:36:54,100
and made me return
to the Reflection of Time you arranged.

574
00:36:56,080 --> 00:36:57,490
I don't think

575
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:59,510
you need to ask me why I did it.

576
00:37:03,120 --> 00:37:04,790
Actually, everything
that's happening right now

577
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:06,640
is what you experienced

578
00:37:06,730 --> 00:37:07,960
more than 20 years ago

579
00:37:08,050 --> 00:37:10,030
in the final Reflection of Time

580
00:37:10,690 --> 00:37:13,420
that Kakarayan showed you, isn't it?

581
00:37:28,820 --> 00:37:30,090
Are you indulging alone

582
00:37:30,180 --> 00:37:31,720
in the Reflection of Time again?

583
00:37:32,780 --> 00:37:33,660
Toem.

584
00:37:34,580 --> 00:37:37,180
You're the goddess of cloud.

585
00:37:37,310 --> 00:37:38,190
Tell me.

586
00:37:41,090 --> 00:37:43,030
When a lie gets found out,

587
00:37:46,900 --> 00:37:48,090
what will happen to it?

588
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,200
Tell me!

589
00:37:52,270 --> 00:37:53,280
[It's just that]

590
00:37:53,370 --> 00:37:55,870
you couldn't accept the fact back then.

591
00:37:56,010 --> 00:37:58,510
Even though you had seen

592
00:37:58,600 --> 00:38:00,980
all the things I did for you
in the Reflection of Time,

593
00:38:02,080 --> 00:38:04,100
you still came to me

594
00:38:04,190 --> 00:38:05,640
just like how it happened
in the Reflection of Time.

595
00:38:07,710 --> 00:38:11,450
What is it that you wish to hear from me?

596
00:38:13,390 --> 00:38:14,710
A different answer?

597
00:38:22,540 --> 00:38:24,650
When are you going
to stop lying to yourself?

598
00:38:25,270 --> 00:38:27,070
You know better than anyone.

599
00:38:27,990 --> 00:38:30,110
This is the end of the lie.

600
00:38:30,330 --> 00:38:32,700
But you chose to keep lying to yourself.

601
00:38:32,790 --> 00:38:33,930
Kakarayan.

602
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:36,490
How much longer are you going to hide

603
00:38:36,570 --> 00:38:37,810
behind this lie?

604
00:38:41,410 --> 00:38:43,440
Why are you calling me Kakarayan?
